#, php-format
msgid "That id is a %s, which cannot carry Blocksy per-post overrides."
msgstr "Ese ID es de tipo %s, que no admite ajustes por entrada de Blocksy."

#: includes/premium/integrations/blocksy.php:877
msgid "Content Blocks are not available on this site. They are a Blocksy Pro feature and register the ct_content_block post type; the free Companion only links to their admin screen."
msgstr "Los Content Blocks no están disponibles en este sitio. Son una función de Blocksy Pro y registran el tipo de contenido ct_content_block; el Companion gratuito solo enlaza a su pantalla de administración."

#: includes/premium/integrations/blocksy.php:948
msgid "A content block id is required and must be a positive integer."
msgstr "Se necesita un ID de content block y debe ser un entero positivo."

#. translators: 1: post type name, 2: the expected post type
#: includes/premium/integrations/blocksy.php:962
