msgstr "Texto"

#: assets/js/studio-builder-sketch.js:81
msgid "e.g. Two sentences on why people love it"
msgstr "p. ej. Dos frases sobre por qué le encanta a la gente"

#: assets/js/studio-builder-sketch.js:82
#: assets/js/studio-builder.js:206
#: assets/js/studio-builder.js:300
